<title>CHINA: SOCCER - CHINA SOCCER LEAGUE STANDINGS.</title>
<headline>SOCCER - CHINA SOCCER LEAGUE STANDINGS.</headline>
<dateline>BEIJING 1997-07-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Following are the standings of</p>
<p>the Chinese professional soccer league after games on Sunday</p>
<p>(tabulated under games played, won, drawn, lost, goals for,</p>
<p>goals against and points):</p>
<p> Dalian Wanda	   10   8   2   0   20    4   26</p>
<p> Beijing Guo'an	 10   4   4   2   20   11   16</p>
<p> Sichuan Quanxing     10   3   6   1   14    8   15</p>
<p> Shanghai Shenhua     10   3   5   2   14   14   14</p>
<p> Qingdao Hainiu	 10   3   4   3    8    7   13</p>
<p> Jinan Taishan	  10   3   4   3    9   10   13</p>
<p> Guangzhou Apollo     10   2   6   2    4    4   12</p>
<p> Vanguard Huandao     10   3   3   4   11   12   12</p>
<p> Yanbian Aodong	 10   3   3   4    6    8   12</p>
<p> Guangdong Hongyuan   10   2   2   6    8   16    8</p>
<p> August First	   10   1   5   4    5   15    8</p>
<p> Tianjin Samsung	10   1   4   5    4   10    7</p>
</text>
